@startuml
title Incident Lifecycle State Machine (I-ITSM)
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor LightSteelBlue
    BorderColor DarkSlateBlue
    ArrowColor Navy
}

[*] --> NEW : Incident Raised by Employee

NEW --> CLASSIFIED : classify (System / NLP)

CLASSIFIED --> ASSIGNED : assign (to Technician)

ASSIGNED --> ACKNOWLEDGED : acknowledge
ASSIGNED --> CLASSIFIED : flagWrongDomain (Reassignment)

ACKNOWLEDGED --> IN_PROGRESS : startInvestigation
ACKNOWLEDGED --> CLASSIFIED : flagWrongDomain (Reassignment)

IN_PROGRESS --> PENDING_INFO : requestInfo (Pauses SLA Clock)
PENDING_INFO --> IN_PROGRESS : provideInfo (Resumes SLA Clock)

IN_PROGRESS --> RESOLVED : resolve (Structured Resolution)

RESOLVED --> IN_PROGRESS : reject (reopenCount + 1)
RESOLVED --> VERIFIED : verify (Confirmed by Employee)

VERIFIED --> CLOSED : close (Attaches Feedback)

CLOSED --> [*] : Terminal State (Transitions Prohibited)

@enduml

